<title>JAPAN: MITSUI CONSTRUCTION AIMS FOR Y10 BLN PROFIT IN '99.</title>
<headline>MITSUI CONSTRUCTION AIMS FOR Y10 BLN PROFIT IN '99.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Construction Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it aims for a parent current profit of 10 billion yen in 1999.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that it aims to cut liabilities, including interest-bearing debts and guarantees on affiliates' debts, by 74 billion yen by 1999.</p>
<p>The company also said it aims to cut its workforce by 400 over the next three years.</p>
</text>
